STEP 9
ADD pin-P 2780 black
CONNECT pin-P.end1 -> turntable-O.base.hole?
ADD pin-Q 2780 black
CONNECT pin-Q.end1 -> turntable-O.base.hole?
ADD beam-R 63869 lightgray
CONNECT pin-P.end2 -> beam-R.hole1
CONNECT pin-Q.end2 -> beam-R.hole3
DOES turntable-O HOLDS pin-P
DOES turntable-O HOLDS pin-Q
DOES pin-P LOCKS beam-R
DOES pin-Q LOCKS beam-R
PATTERN two_pin_mount
